Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, obs-studio (>= 1:33.0.1), libstereo-layer1 (>= 1.23.0)
Enhances: obs-studio
Description: Stereo 3D module for OBS Studio
 Enable 3D makes OBS Studio's canvas full side by side, left eye first, each
 eye at the chosen render resolution. The x264 encoder then writes the frame
 packing arrangement message in every recording and stream; before a start, OBS
 says which encoder or file mark cannot be written and why. The Stereo input
 filter takes a source in any packing of the stereo layer's list to full side
 by side, with the swap of the eyes for a source whose mark is wrong.
